    <item>
      <title>GoPro以每股1.14美元被Starman收购 股东获2.85亿美元现金</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260905/GoPro%E4%BB%A5%E6%AF%8F%E8%82%A11.14%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E8%A2%ABStarman%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%AD-%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%9C%E8%8E%B72.85%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E7%8E%B0%E9%87%91/</link>
